**Rule sets.** This is a BlueStep One component workspace. Components are built, published and
checked with `/bluestep-one:build`, one gate at a time; the details of each gate and the BlueStep
One rules, patterns and gotchas are in `/bluestep-one:reference`. The project's values (the
BlueStep One host and git host, the components, the test-data prefix) are in
`.claude/bluestep-one.json`; no rule below repeats them. The B6P platform rules and the GraphQL
reference come from the `bluestep-tools` plugin.

- Never edit `types/`: the seven type files are downloaded before every publish.
- Stage files by name; never `git add .` in a component repo (its remote is the platform's git).
- Publish only on the user's yes for that publish, unless a rule below says otherwise.
- Live checks run only on test records named with the test-data prefix.

